title: 'Gnomon dogfood day: trace, helper 1.5.0, GUI fixes, run modes'
summary: |-
  Founder dogfooding, 2026-10-19 afternoon. Everything is merged to feat/gnomon at 9cfb82f6 with CI green.

  - gnomon trace plus a per-project capture under the Gnomon home (TD-139, amended by TD-057 after an Aegis block).
  - Helper 1.5.0: root signs now return `shown`. Before this, every real guided setup failed with helper-line-mismatch, and the fake helper hid the bug. Signed and notarized locally.
  - GUI. It had never shown a live session: the store read LogRow flat while the kernel sends it nested, and the launch-token GUI got a community-client view. Both are fixed, with an e2e test. Also added a full-window layout, a chat transcript, sticky scroll matching the founder's exact rules, a fix for scroll snap-back, and stale-session handling.
  - Run modes manual / ask / auto-edits, with ⇧Tab and `gnomon mode`. Aegis blocked twice (dangling symlinks, the gate-class list), and every finding is fixed.
  - Agent maxTurns aligned to 100.
  - Next: voice (T-026, founder request).
